    {
      "text": "\\begin{figure}[H]\n\\centering\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.012cm,y=1.1cm]\n  \\draw[->] (0,0.8) -- (520,0.8) node[right] {\\small $t$};\n  \\draw[->] (0,0.8) -- (0,5.3) node[above] {\\small $F(\\beta_t)$};\n  \\draw[thick,blue!60!black,domain=0:500,samples=60] plot (\\x, {1 + 4*exp(-\\x/120)});\n  \\draw[dashed] (0,1) -- (500,1);\n  \\foreach \\t in {0,100,...,500}\n    \\draw (\\t,0.8) -- (\\t,0.7) node[below] {\\small \\t};\n\\end{tikzpicture}\n\\caption{Objective value of Algorithm 1 against the iteration count (normalised so that the optimum is 1).}\n\\label{fig:conv}\n\\end{figure}",
      "type": "RawLatex"
    },
    {
      "level": 1,
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Discussion",
