        {
          "label": "tab:results",
          "kind": "ref",
          "type": "CrossRef"
        },
        {
          "text": " confirm that exploiting sparsity does not cost accuracy: the extra iterations gained within a fixed time budget translate directly into a better solution of Equation ",
